<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:02.100" end="00:00:07.200" style="s2">Nolan Graves is back.</p>
<p begin="00:00:04.800" end="00:00:08.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If one day the person who loved you most</p>
<p begin="00:00:07.200" end="00:00:10.900" style="s2">suddenly forgot he ever loved you,</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.500" end="00:00:10.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nolan!</p>
<p begin="00:00:11.500" end="00:00:14.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; would you prove the past?</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.700" end="00:00:15.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.000" end="00:00:17.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Or accept that he doesn&#39;t want you</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.200" end="00:00:18.000" style="s2">anymore? Very funny.</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.300" end="00:00:19.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nolan?</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.000" end="00:00:19.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t touch me.</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.000" end="00:00:20.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.400" end="00:00:20.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you acting like you don&#39;t know</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.400" end="00:00:23.000" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.800" end="00:00:24.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know you. Lena Morris,</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.000" end="00:00:25.800" style="s2">the girl who&#39;s always around me.</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.400" end="00:00:26.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s doing it again. She never gives</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.800" end="00:00:27.200" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.200" end="00:00:28.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Doing what?</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.200" end="00:00:30.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You waited outside Student Council? You</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.400" end="00:00:32.500" style="s2">bring him coffee?</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.000" end="00:00:34.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You ridiculous coffee.</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.500" end="00:00:35.700" style="s2">You asked me to wait for you.</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.400" end="00:00:36.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did I?</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.700" end="00:00:38.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re my boyfriend.</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.800" end="00:00:39.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boyfriend? Wow.</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.700" end="00:00:40.400" style="s2">So that&#39;s the story [music] now?</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.800" end="00:00:41.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Story?</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.400" end="00:00:43.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You waited for me, you bring me coffee,</p>
<p begin="00:00:41.400" end="00:00:43.700" style="s2">you had a crush on me. I didn&#39;t return</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.300" end="00:00:44.400" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.700" end="00:00:45.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.400" end="00:00:47.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And now we were dating?</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.600" end="00:00:50.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s not in my head. You kissed me last</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.700" end="00:00:50.900" style="s2">night. You held me. You told me you</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.100" end="00:00:51.900" style="s2">loved me.</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.900" end="00:00:53.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone&#39;s looking.</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.900" end="00:00:54.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let them.</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.500" end="00:00:55.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I love you.</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.200" end="00:00:57.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then prove it. [music] Pictures?</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.900" end="00:00:58.100" style="s2">Messages?</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.700" end="00:00:59.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.100" end="00:01:00.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.400" end="00:01:02.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You loved me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.300" end="00:01:03.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody remembers that. Neither do I.</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.300" end="00:01:04.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.000" end="00:01:05.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because if I ever loved you, I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.400" end="00:01:06.400" style="s2">remember.</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.199" end="00:01:08.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lena,</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.400" end="00:01:10.140" style="s2">maybe you should talk to someone.</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.120" end="00:01:10.140" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.635" end="00:01:19.200" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.945" end="00:01:20.200" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.200" end="00:01:22.600" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:01:20.200" end="00:01:22.600" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.000" end="00:01:27.200" style="s2">Did I</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.400" end="00:01:27.200" style="s2">Did I make it up?</p>
<p begin="00:01:28.425" end="00:01:30.445" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.000" end="00:01:39.100" style="s2">I knew it.</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.600" end="00:01:42.200" style="s2">You loved me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.100" end="00:01:45.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I&#39;m not crazy, then who made everyone</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.200" end="00:01:48.700" style="s2">forget he loved me? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.200" end="00:01:50.700" style="s2">No sugar, extra shot.</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.700" end="00:01:51.800" style="s2">Still doing this? She brought him coffee</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.700" end="00:01:53.200" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.800" end="00:01:55.700" style="s2">That&#39;s commitment.</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.200" end="00:01:57.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He said no, Lena. He didn&#39;t reject me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.700" end="00:01:58.556" style="s2">He forgot me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.000" end="00:01:59.600" style="s2">That&#39;s worse. Where are the pictures?</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.556" end="00:02:00.492" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.600" end="00:02:02.692" style="s2">The</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.492" end="00:02:04.692" style="s2">They&#39;re gone. Nolan? Everyone remembers</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.692" end="00:02:05.792" style="s2">you following him. Nobody remembers him</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.692" end="00:02:06.592" style="s2">wanting you there.</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.792" end="00:02:07.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m in class.</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.592" end="00:02:10.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on. [music] Maybe drink it</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.992" end="00:02:10.492" style="s2">yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.692" end="00:02:14.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you still here?</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.892" end="00:02:15.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because yesterday you would have stayed.</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.292" end="00:02:15.792" style="s2">You would have never let them talk to me</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.392" end="00:02:16.992" style="s2">like that. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.792" end="00:02:19.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know who I was yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.992" end="00:02:21.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do.</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.092" end="00:02:21.992" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.192" end="00:02:24.292" style="s2">Just try.</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.992" end="00:02:24.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lena!</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.292" end="00:02:29.996" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know I can protect myself.</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.992" end="00:02:30.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. Let me do it anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.996" end="00:02:32.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.692" end="00:02:33.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You put me on your left.</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.192" end="00:02:34.581" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.592" end="00:02:34.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You always do that.</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.581" end="00:02:36.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.692" end="00:02:39.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Reflex.</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.392" end="00:02:39.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You always said that, too.</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.492" end="00:02:44.892" style="s2">You don&#39;t remember [music] me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.092" end="00:02:44.892" style="s2">But something does.</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.892" end="00:02:54.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perfect synchronization.</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.392" end="00:02:56.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought she made it all up.</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.592" end="00:02:56.892" style="s2">Seriously? Professor Nolan can partner</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.492" end="00:02:58.192" style="s2">with me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.892" end="00:02:59.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The pairings are final.</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.192" end="00:03:02.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Follow my lead.</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.292" end="00:03:02.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You still say that.</p>
<p begin="00:03:06.677" end="00:03:08.642" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.592" end="00:03:08.692" style="s2">That&#39;s twice.</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.642" end="00:03:09.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.692" end="00:03:10.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.292" end="00:03:12.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have you two trained together before?</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.992" end="00:03:13.882" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did you know my timing?</p>
<p begin="00:03:12.392" end="00:03:15.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I knew you.</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.882" end="00:03:15.902" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.192" end="00:03:19.592" style="s2">Lena.</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.092" end="00:03:23.292" style="s2">How did you know my timing?</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.892" end="00:03:24.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you.</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.292" end="00:03:25.992" style="s2">I knew you. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.892" end="00:03:27.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe we trained together.</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.992" end="00:03:30.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right. There&#39;s always another</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.492" end="00:03:30.192" style="s2">explanation.</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.392" end="00:03:46.092" style="s2">[panting and sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:03:42.992" end="00:03:48.792" style="s2">There&#39;s always another explanation.</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.092" end="00:03:48.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did I know?</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.392" end="00:03:51.192" style="s2">Do it again.</p>
<p begin="00:03:50.492" end="00:03:52.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.192" end="00:03:53.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The spell that hit Lena.</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.692" end="00:03:54.292" style="s2">Do it again.</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.492" end="00:03:56.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t attack her.</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.292" end="00:03:58.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then prove it.</p>
<p begin="00:03:56.992" end="00:04:00.592" style="s2">That isn&#39;t mine.</p>
<p begin="00:03:58.392" end="00:04:02.894" style="s2">What happened? I thought I lost control,</p>
<p begin="00:04:00.592" end="00:04:05.494" style="s2">but something pulled it. toward Lena,</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.894" end="00:04:05.494" style="s2">straight at her.</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.494" end="00:04:10.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are you going?</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.494" end="00:04:10.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To find Lena.</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.794" end="00:04:17.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, well, your stalker is here.</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.694" end="00:04:20.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not stalking her.</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.994" end="00:04:20.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure.</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.694" end="00:04:24.994" style="s2">What do you want?</p>
<p begin="00:04:23.894" end="00:04:25.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My handwriting.</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.994" end="00:04:27.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:04:25.494" end="00:04:28.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course you do. Yesterday wasn&#39;t an</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.294" end="00:04:30.094" style="s2">accident.</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.494" end="00:04:30.494" style="s2">Someone pulled that spell towards you.</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.094" end="00:04:31.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who?</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.494" end="00:04:32.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.194" end="00:04:33.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So now you believe me?</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.094" end="00:04:34.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I believe none of this makes sense.</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.994" end="00:04:35.894" style="s2">You coming?</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.894" end="00:04:37.068" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re asking me?</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.894" end="00:04:37.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t make me regret it.</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.068" end="00:04:40.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.294" end="00:04:40.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too late, Mr. President.</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.494" end="00:04:47.694" style="s2">It&#39;s ruined.</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.494" end="00:04:49.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.694" end="00:04:51.594" style="s2">You run Student Council.</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.694" end="00:04:52.494" style="s2">I know dead paper.</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.594" end="00:04:55.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dead paper?</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.494" end="00:04:55.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It remembers better than people.</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.894" end="00:05:02.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re good. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.794" end="00:05:03.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.613" end="00:05:06.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.894" end="00:05:06.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.543" end="00:05:08.563" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.394" end="00:05:13.094" style="s2">I found something.</p>
<p begin="00:05:17.294" end="00:05:22.294" style="s2">The spell.</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.094" end="00:05:22.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It carried the spell&#39;s resonance.</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.794" end="00:05:25.494" style="s2">Someone&#39;s using it.</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.594" end="00:05:32.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You two look good together.</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.394" end="00:05:32.594" style="s2">Finally someone noticed.</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.294" end="00:05:36.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seriously?</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.194" end="00:05:36.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Much better.</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.594" end="00:05:47.808" style="s2">Pretty.</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.894" end="00:05:48.494" style="s2">Does it restore fake memories, too?</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.808" end="00:05:49.694" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.494" end="00:05:52.794" style="s2">Guys,</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.694" end="00:05:54.394" style="s2">she actually believes it. You know what?</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.794" end="00:05:56.294" style="s2">If he wants you,</p>
<p begin="00:05:54.394" end="00:06:00.094" style="s2">that&#39;s his choice.</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.294" end="00:06:00.094" style="s2">But don&#39;t tell me my life didn&#39;t happen.</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.494" end="00:06:03.894" style="s2">There is no proof.</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.094" end="00:06:05.295" style="s2">Then why are you so scared?</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.894" end="00:06:07.395" style="s2">Scared of what?</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.295" end="00:06:09.695" style="s2">That he might believe me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.395" end="00:06:09.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough.</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.995" end="00:06:14.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nolan, we&#39;re just talking.</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.195" end="00:06:14.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.895" end="00:06:19.695" style="s2">You&#39;re making her a joke.</p>
<p begin="00:06:16.795" end="00:06:19.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t even believe her.</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.095" end="00:06:24.595" style="s2">I don&#39;t know what happened, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.795" end="00:06:24.595" style="s2">but she&#39;s not crazy.</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.695" end="00:06:27.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since when do you defend her?</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.795" end="00:06:32.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.695" end="00:06:32.395" style="s2">That&#39;s the problem.</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.895" end="00:06:39.295" style="s2">Lena,</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.695" end="00:06:39.295" style="s2">I need your [music] help.</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.495" end="00:06:40.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow.</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.995" end="00:06:41.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.695" end="00:06:43.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You need me now?</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.495" end="00:06:45.504" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t enjoy this.</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.095" end="00:06:45.504" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too late. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:47.395" end="00:06:49.695" style="s2">Wait.</p>
