<p begin="00:07:23.395" end="00:07:25.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.495" end="00:07:28.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.995" end="00:07:29.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The bell.</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.195" end="00:07:30.995" style="s2">You know something.</p>
