<p begin="00:07:50.295" end="00:07:54.695" style="s2">and she wasn&#39;t affected.</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.095" end="00:07:55.495" style="s2">That&#39;s the strange part.</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.695" end="00:07:57.195" style="s2">What is this?</p>
