<p begin="00:07:57.195" end="00:08:02.595" style="s2">I&#39;m serious.</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.695" end="00:08:02.595" style="s2">I know less than you think.</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.695" end="00:08:04.395" style="s2">That wasn&#39;t there yesterday.</p>
