<p begin="00:25:33.607" end="00:25:36.807" style="s2">before the reset. What happened between</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.408" end="00:25:38.807" style="s2">you two after that?</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.807" end="00:25:40.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So the bell didn&#39;t fail.</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.807" end="00:25:40.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It just hasn&#39;t learned what to erase</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.007" end="00:25:41.908" style="s2">yet.</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.507" end="00:25:42.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.908" end="00:25:43.707" style="s2">That&#39;s good news.</p>
<p begin="00:25:42.908" end="00:25:46.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How?</p>
<p begin="00:25:43.707" end="00:25:48.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I like you.</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.007" end="00:25:50.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re very annoying.</p>
<p begin="00:25:48.207" end="00:25:53.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said that about the old me too.</p>
<p begin="00:25:50.207" end="00:25:53.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Some things survive anything.</p>
<p begin="00:25:54.507" end="00:25:58.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.807" end="00:25:58.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You moved.</p>
<p begin="00:25:59.707" end="00:26:01.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did?</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.607" end="00:26:04.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm.</p>
<p begin="00:26:01.707" end="00:26:04.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Guess I&#39;m learning.</p>
<p begin="00:26:04.507" end="00:26:06.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:26:08.007" end="00:26:10.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You moved.</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.107" end="00:26:16.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did?</p>
<p begin="00:26:14.107" end="00:26:16.807" style="s2">Guess I&#39;m learning.</p>
<p begin="00:26:25.908" end="00:26:29.408" style="s2">Let&#39;s see what survives next time. The</p>
<p begin="00:26:27.707" end="00:26:31.909" style="s2">system didn&#39;t erase it because it wasn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:26:29.408" end="00:26:31.909" style="s2">there before.</p>
<p begin="00:26:32.909" end="00:26:35.509" style="s2">Now it is.</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.809" end="00:26:41.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She said she&#39;s still here.</p>
<p begin="00:26:38.709" end="00:26:41.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:26:41.209" end="00:26:44.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why are we standing here?</p>
<p begin="00:26:42.609" end="00:26:46.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That door hasn&#39;t opened in 20 years.</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.409" end="00:26:47.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then tonight&#39;s special.</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.309" end="00:26:47.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There she is.</p>
<p begin="00:26:47.209" end="00:26:50.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:26:47.709" end="00:26:50.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.248" end="00:26:57.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.709" end="00:26:59.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nolan?</p>
<p begin="00:26:57.809" end="00:27:00.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.709" end="00:27:03.609" style="s2">Apparently you know me.</p>
<p begin="00:27:00.909" end="00:27:03.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Unfortunately.</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.209" end="00:27:14.909" style="s2">These belong to people.</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.009" end="00:27:16.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lena, below.</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.909" end="00:27:18.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maisie?</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.809" end="00:27:20.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go.</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.009" end="00:27:20.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Floor.</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.209" end="00:27:23.709" style="s2">I&#39;ll go with [music] you.</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.009" end="00:27:26.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to.</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.709" end="00:27:26.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.609" end="00:27:29.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lena?</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.409" end="00:27:33.809" style="s2">Maisie!</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.409" end="00:27:35.809" style="s2">If you can see this,</p>
<p begin="00:27:33.809" end="00:27:38.709" style="s2">don&#39;t let them mark you.</p>
<p begin="00:27:35.809" end="00:27:38.709" style="s2">Because once they do</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.809" end="00:27:50.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re leaving campus.</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.109" end="00:27:51.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Excuse me?</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.809" end="00:27:52.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today.</p>
<p begin="00:27:51.609" end="00:27:55.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.409" end="00:27:55.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t a discussion.</p>
<p begin="00:27:55.109" end="00:27:56.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There he is.</p>
<p begin="00:27:55.909" end="00:27:59.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.809" end="00:27:59.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. President.</p>
<p begin="00:28:00.509" end="00:28:04.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lena, the system marked you.</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.509" end="00:28:04.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And Maisie is still down there.</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.109" end="00:28:06.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll find her.</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.809" end="00:28:07.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I sit somewhere safe while you</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.109" end="00:28:08.809" style="s2">decide everything?</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.109" end="00:28:10.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m trying to keep you alive.</p>
<p begin="00:28:08.809" end="00:28:11.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:28:10.209" end="00:28:12.609" style="s2">But stop telling me what I&#39;m allowed to</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.709" end="00:28:14.309" style="s2">risk.</p>
<p begin="00:28:12.609" end="00:28:15.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if I can&#39;t watch it happen again?</p>
<p begin="00:28:14.309" end="00:28:18.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then be [clears throat] scared. Just</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.709" end="00:28:18.609" style="s2">don&#39;t lock me out.</p>
<p begin="00:28:18.809" end="00:28:21.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.109" end="00:28:23.909" style="s2">But you&#39;re not going alone.</p>
<p begin="00:28:21.209" end="00:28:23.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That I can live with.</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.809" end="00:28:28.309" style="s2">You know it?</p>
<p begin="00:28:30.509" end="00:28:33.709" style="s2">Nolan?</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.909" end="00:28:36.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My My</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.709" end="00:28:39.410" style="s2">That&#39;s her authorization seal.</p>
<p begin="00:28:36.510" end="00:28:39.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone has to.</p>
<p begin="00:28:42.910" end="00:28:46.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She knew.</p>
<p begin="00:28:44.610" end="00:28:48.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like it.</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.310" end="00:28:48.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All this time?</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.610" end="00:28:55.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Subject Lena Morris has become a risk to</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.310" end="00:28:55.310" style="s2">the ward. Prepare her for extraction.</p>
<p begin="00:29:00.910" end="00:29:04.285" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You could knock.</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.610" end="00:29:04.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You could have told me.</p>
<p begin="00:29:04.285" end="00:29:06.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:04.910" end="00:29:08.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This doesn&#39;t concern her.</p>
<p begin="00:29:06.310" end="00:29:09.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her name is on it.</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.110" end="00:29:10.010" style="s2">What is the Echo Archive?</p>
<p begin="00:29:09.310" end="00:29:11.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, Lynn.</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.010" end="00:29:12.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:29:11.610" end="00:29:13.110" style="s2">Did you erase me? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.610" end="00:29:13.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:29:13.110" end="00:29:14.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then who did?</p>
<p begin="00:29:13.810" end="00:29:15.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You asked for it.</p>
<p begin="00:29:14.910" end="00:29:18.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a lie.</p>
<p begin="00:29:15.710" end="00:29:19.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have your authorization.</p>
<p begin="00:29:18.210" end="00:29:22.810" style="s2">Subject Lena Morris has become a risk to</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.810" end="00:29:25.310" style="s2">the ward. Prepare her for extraction.</p>
<p begin="00:29:22.810" end="00:29:25.310" style="s2">Because of her.</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.810" end="00:29:28.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t look at her.</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.310" end="00:29:35.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The bell is part of the campus ward.</p>
<p begin="00:29:33.510" end="00:29:37.110" style="s2">And the memories?</p>
<p begin="00:29:35.710" end="00:29:40.210" style="s2">What are they for?</p>
<p begin="00:29:37.110" end="00:29:40.210" style="s2">Keeping this place [music] standing.</p>
<p begin="00:29:40.810" end="00:29:43.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maisie?</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.710" end="00:29:44.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alive. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:43.710" end="00:29:46.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where?</p>
<p begin="00:29:44.310" end="00:29:48.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Contained. That&#39;s not an answer.</p>
<p begin="00:29:46.710" end="00:29:50.110" style="s2">You survived the ninth overtone because</p>
<p begin="00:29:48.210" end="00:29:53.010" style="s2">your device filtered the frequency. So</p>
<p begin="00:29:50.110" end="00:29:53.010" style="s2">you knew I wasn&#39;t lying.</p>
<p begin="00:29:53.710" end="00:29:56.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You let everyone think she was crazy.</p>
<p begin="00:29:55.610" end="00:29:58.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I protected the school.</p>
<p begin="00:29:56.910" end="00:30:01.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You watched me hurt her.</p>
<p begin="00:29:58.310" end="00:30:01.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I watched you survive.</p>
<p begin="00:30:01.710" end="00:30:05.255" style="s2">You have no idea what you were trying to</p>
<p begin="00:30:03.210" end="00:30:05.255" style="s2">stop. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.910" end="00:30:13.510" style="s2">If the archive fails,</p>
<p begin="00:30:10.510" end="00:30:13.510" style="s2">the ward fails [music] with it.</p>
<p begin="00:30:18.210" end="00:30:21.310" style="s2">The archive absorbs unstable memory</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.910" end="00:30:22.610" style="s2">resonance. Without it, the ward</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.310" end="00:30:23.810" style="s2">collapses.</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.610" end="00:30:25.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you take students?</p>
<p begin="00:30:23.810" end="00:30:26.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We take what the system requires.</p>
<p begin="00:30:25.610" end="00:30:29.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s your defense?</p>
<p begin="00:30:26.810" end="00:30:29.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s the reason you&#39;re alive.</p>
<p begin="00:30:31.210" end="00:30:33.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was here the last time the ward</p>
<p begin="00:30:32.410" end="00:30:35.510" style="s2">failed.</p>
<p begin="00:30:33.510" end="00:30:37.412" style="s2">I buried students your age.</p>
<p begin="00:30:35.510" end="00:30:40.112" style="s2">So</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.412" end="00:30:40.112" style="s2">I made a choice.</p>
<p begin="00:30:40.512" end="00:30:42.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Say something.</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.212" end="00:30:43.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want me to say?</p>
<p begin="00:30:42.212" end="00:30:45.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.812" end="00:30:46.466" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then don&#39;t decide tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.912" end="00:30:46.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lena.</p>
<p begin="00:30:46.466" end="00:30:48.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:30:46.912" end="00:30:51.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s your mother.</p>
<p begin="00:30:48.712" end="00:30:52.712" style="s2">You&#39;re allowed to be confused.</p>
<p begin="00:30:51.012" end="00:30:53.912" style="s2">You said this was harmless.</p>
<p begin="00:30:52.712" end="00:30:55.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is.</p>
<p begin="00:30:53.912" end="00:30:56.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You knew.</p>
<p begin="00:30:55.112" end="00:30:56.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone has memories they&#39;d be better</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.312" end="00:30:59.912" style="s2">without.</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.812" end="00:30:59.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t get to decide that.</p>
<p begin="00:31:07.512" end="00:31:10.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Access revoked.</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.912" end="00:31:13.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell?</p>
<p begin="00:31:14.312" end="00:31:18.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:31:15.912" end="00:31:18.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bring her in.</p>
<p begin="00:31:26.012" end="00:31:28.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lena.</p>
<p begin="00:31:28.712" end="00:31:32.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ghost.</p>
<p begin="00:31:30.712" end="00:31:34.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nolen, stop.</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.412" end="00:31:37.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get away from the mark.</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.012" end="00:31:38.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t. Nolen.</p>
<p begin="00:31:37.212" end="00:31:39.712" style="s2">It&#39;s Doll.</p>
<p begin="00:31:38.812" end="00:31:41.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:31:39.712" end="00:31:44.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He took your mother&#39;s access.</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.912" end="00:31:44.712" style="s2">He&#39;s coming for her.</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.812" end="00:31:50.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lena Morris.</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.612" end="00:31:51.812" style="s2">Stop resisting.</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.512" end="00:31:52.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not really my thing.</p>
<p begin="00:31:51.812" end="00:31:54.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:31:52.712" end="00:31:56.512" style="s2">I&#39;ve noticed. Your hearing device makes</p>
<p begin="00:31:54.612" end="00:31:57.912" style="s2">you resistant to the ninth over phone.</p>
<p begin="00:31:56.512" end="00:31:59.212" style="s2">That makes you valuable.</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.912" end="00:32:00.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You mean useful.</p>
<p begin="00:31:59.212" end="00:32:03.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take my anchor.</p>
<p begin="00:32:00.812" end="00:32:05.912" style="s2">You already tried that once.</p>
<p begin="00:32:03.012" end="00:32:05.912" style="s2">Look how well that ended.</p>
<p begin="00:32:15.912" end="00:32:21.012" style="s2">You carry what the bell couldn&#39;t take.</p>
<p begin="00:32:18.112" end="00:32:21.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you&#39;re scared of that.</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.512" end="00:32:26.737" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lena.</p>
<p begin="00:32:24.717" end="00:32:26.737" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:32:29.302" end="00:32:32.912" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:29.412" end="00:32:32.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t protect her this time.</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.313" end="00:32:53.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You came back for me?</p>
<p begin="00:32:51.513" end="00:32:54.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t make it weird.</p>
<p begin="00:32:53.213" end="00:32:56.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I could get used to this.</p>
<p begin="00:32:54.313" end="00:32:56.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:32:58.777" end="00:33:02.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.613" end="00:33:03.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m slowing you down.</p>
<p begin="00:33:02.713" end="00:33:04.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow.</p>
<p begin="00:33:03.713" end="00:33:06.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.513" end="00:33:07.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Perfect finally admits he&#39;s bad at</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.213" end="00:33:08.113" style="s2">something.</p>
<p begin="00:33:07.213" end="00:33:11.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m bleeding.</p>
<p begin="00:33:08.113" end="00:33:11.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And still dramatic.</p>
<p begin="00:33:11.513" end="00:33:13.913" style="s2">Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:33:19.113" end="00:33:23.413" style="s2">Who is that?</p>
<p begin="00:33:20.613" end="00:33:23.413" style="s2">I don&#39;t remember.</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.713" end="00:33:26.413" style="s2">Now you know.</p>
<p begin="00:33:41.413" end="00:33:44.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If Dahl has a copy, he doesn&#39;t need Lena</p>
<p begin="00:33:43.213" end="00:33:45.713" style="s2">physically anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:33:44.813" end="00:33:48.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That sounds good.</p>
<p begin="00:33:45.713" end="00:33:48.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s not.</p>
<p begin="00:33:49.213" end="00:33:53.813" style="s2">He can use the copy to find every memory</p>
<p begin="00:33:51.113" end="00:33:53.813" style="s2">connected to you.</p>
<p begin="00:33:59.813" end="00:34:02.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nope.</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.013" end="00:34:07.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My anchor started this.</p>
<p begin="00:34:05.813" end="00:34:09.813" style="s2">If Dahl wants one, he can have mine.</p>
<p begin="00:34:07.713" end="00:34:10.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out.</p>
<p begin="00:34:09.813" end="00:34:12.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lena.</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.313" end="00:34:12.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out.</p>
