<p begin="00:41:49.518" end="00:41:53.518" style="s2">I was scared yesterday</p>
<p begin="00:41:51.318" end="00:41:55.418" style="s2">when you said you didn&#39;t want us back.</p>
<p begin="00:41:53.518" end="00:41:57.518" style="s2">I wanted to convince you.</p>
<p begin="00:41:55.418" end="00:41:59.418" style="s2">Then I remembered you said no.</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.518" end="00:42:00.818" style="s2">So I went home.</p>
<p begin="00:41:59.418" end="00:42:03.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Congratulations. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:42:00.818" end="00:42:03.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;d take one.</p>
<p begin="00:42:09.118" end="00:42:11.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nolan.</p>
<p begin="00:42:13.618" end="00:42:16.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I remember.</p>
<p begin="00:42:18.418" end="00:42:22.018" style="s2">It&#39;s a fragment. I know. Don&#39;t force</p>
<p begin="00:42:20.718" end="00:42:22.918" style="s2">more.</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.018" end="00:42:25.818" style="s2">You could scramble everything you&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.918" end="00:42:25.818" style="s2">made since the reset.</p>
<p begin="00:42:27.418" end="00:42:31.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you remember?</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.818" end="00:42:32.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The lake.</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.118" end="00:42:33.518" style="s2">You kissed me.</p>
<p begin="00:42:32.518" end="00:42:34.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You kissed me first.</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.518" end="00:42:38.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not how I remember it.</p>
<p begin="00:42:34.818" end="00:42:38.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your memory is obviously still broken.</p>
<p begin="00:42:38.718" end="00:42:41.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:42:39.918" end="00:42:43.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:42:41.418" end="00:42:44.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lena.</p>
<p begin="00:42:43.318" end="00:42:47.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happens if all of it comes back?</p>
<p begin="00:42:44.918" end="00:42:47.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I remember.</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.918" end="00:42:50.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And this?</p>
<p begin="00:42:57.520" end="00:43:01.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I remember kissing you by the lake.</p>
<p begin="00:43:00.020" end="00:43:03.720" style="s2">I also remember you threatening to kill</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.320" end="00:43:05.320" style="s2">me over one fry yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:43:03.720" end="00:43:07.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You deserved it.</p>
<p begin="00:43:05.320" end="00:43:10.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Probably.</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.320" end="00:43:10.320" style="s2">One doesn&#39;t erase the other.</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.920" end="00:43:17.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:43:16.220" end="00:43:20.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Faster.</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.520" end="00:43:20.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m working.</p>
<p begin="00:43:20.920" end="00:43:23.320" style="s2">Lena!</p>
<p begin="00:43:23.820" end="00:43:27.420" style="s2">Maisie?</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.920" end="00:43:28.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maisie!</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.420" end="00:43:29.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lena!</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.120" end="00:43:30.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s right there.</p>
<p begin="00:43:29.720" end="00:43:33.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:43:30.920" end="00:43:33.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t make me leave.</p>
<p begin="00:43:35.720" end="00:43:39.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell me what you need.</p>
<p begin="00:43:38.020" end="00:43:40.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 30 seconds.</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.520" end="00:43:42.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have 20.</p>
<p begin="00:43:40.820" end="00:43:44.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 25.</p>
<p begin="00:43:42.520" end="00:43:44.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal.</p>
<p begin="00:43:50.020" end="00:43:52.720" style="s2">WE NEED TO GO.</p>
<p begin="00:43:53.620" end="00:43:56.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LENA!</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.320" end="00:44:05.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THIS GETS YOU INTO THE LOWER ARCHIVE.</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.720" end="00:44:07.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHERE DID you get it?</p>
<p begin="00:44:05.820" end="00:44:08.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you really want to know?</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.520" end="00:44:10.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.220" end="00:44:10.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Smart.</p>
<p begin="00:44:12.120" end="00:44:16.320" style="s2">I need to tell you something, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:44:14.420" end="00:44:17.920" style="s2">After the reset, Nolan asked me if you</p>
<p begin="00:44:16.320" end="00:44:20.320" style="s2">were always around him.</p>
<p begin="00:44:17.920" end="00:44:22.320" style="s2">I told him yes. That was true. I didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:44:20.320" end="00:44:23.920" style="s2">tell me why.</p>
<p begin="00:44:22.320" end="00:44:26.020" style="s2">I found a note.</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.920" end="00:44:27.620" style="s2">Your names were on it.</p>
<p begin="00:44:26.020" end="00:44:28.120" style="s2">I hid it.</p>
<p begin="00:44:27.620" end="00:44:30.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena.</p>
<p begin="00:44:28.120" end="00:44:30.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:44:31.020" end="00:44:35.520" style="s2">Because I liked him.</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.120" end="00:44:38.320" style="s2">And for once, you were out of the way.</p>
<p begin="00:44:35.520" end="00:44:40.220" style="s2">I didn&#39;t know what the bell did.</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.320" end="00:44:41.920" style="s2">But when I started figuring it out,</p>
<p begin="00:44:40.220" end="00:44:44.220" style="s2">I still didn&#39;t tell you. [music] I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.920" end="00:44:45.920" style="s2">sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:44:44.220" end="00:44:48.220" style="s2">Help us get Maisie back.</p>
<p begin="00:44:45.920" end="00:44:48.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will.</p>
<p begin="00:44:52.720" end="00:44:56.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give it back.</p>
<p begin="00:44:53.921" end="00:44:56.421" style="s2">Come get it.</p>
<p begin="00:45:00.221" end="00:45:03.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew her.</p>
<p begin="00:45:01.221" end="00:45:04.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:45:03.121" end="00:45:05.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She was my friend.</p>
<p begin="00:45:04.621" end="00:45:08.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:45:05.921" end="00:45:08.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I forgot her.</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.121" end="00:45:12.221" style="s2">If Serena ever says she hates me, she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:45:11.621" end="00:45:13.221" style="s2">lying.</p>
<p begin="00:45:12.221" end="00:45:15.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hate you.</p>
<p begin="00:45:13.221" end="00:45:15.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See?</p>
<p begin="00:45:28.421" end="00:45:31.921" style="s2">She took something from me, too.</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.221" end="00:45:44.721" style="s2">Maisie?</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.921" end="00:45:47.521" style="s2">Who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:45:51.686" end="00:45:53.921" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:45:52.221" end="00:45:56.521" style="s2">My name is Lena.</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.921" end="00:45:58.221" style="s2">Do I know you?</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.521" end="00:46:00.921" style="s2">Yeah. But it&#39;s okay if you don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.221" end="00:46:00.921" style="s2">remember yet.</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.321" end="00:46:06.621" style="s2">My name is Maisie Carter. Lena Morris is</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.821" end="00:46:08.521" style="s2">my best friend.</p>
<p begin="00:46:06.621" end="00:46:11.221" style="s2">And if I forget her,</p>
<p begin="00:46:08.521" end="00:46:11.221" style="s2">trust her.</p>
<p begin="00:46:13.021" end="00:46:17.221" style="s2">Lena?</p>
<p begin="00:46:14.521" end="00:46:17.221" style="s2">I know that name.</p>
<p begin="00:46:20.921" end="00:46:23.321" style="s2">You look terrible.</p>
<p begin="00:46:22.121" end="00:46:28.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You remember me?</p>
<p begin="00:46:23.321" end="00:46:29.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Unfortunate familiarity. Okay, too much.</p>
<p begin="00:46:28.121" end="00:46:30.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You okay?</p>
<p begin="00:46:29.121" end="00:46:31.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ask me later.</p>
<p begin="00:46:30.421" end="00:46:34.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal.</p>
<p begin="00:46:31.521" end="00:46:34.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have to leave.</p>
<p begin="00:46:42.521" end="00:46:48.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:46:44.721" end="00:46:51.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because this isn&#39;t the archive.</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.121" end="00:46:51.421" style="s2">The archive is just feeding it.</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.421" end="00:47:00.323" style="s2">That&#39;s what Doll wants.</p>
<p begin="00:47:13.023" end="00:47:16.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If it reaches zero, the bell hits the</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.323" end="00:47:18.723" style="s2">whole campus.</p>
<p begin="00:47:16.122" end="00:47:21.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And everyone forgets?</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.723" end="00:47:21.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know what they&#39;ll forget.</p>
<p begin="00:47:23.823" end="00:47:25.922" style="s2">I can stop it.</p>
<p begin="00:47:25.023" end="00:47:27.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:47:25.922" end="00:47:29.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My signature is already in the system.</p>
<p begin="00:47:27.922" end="00:47:30.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We just had this fight.</p>
<p begin="00:47:29.422" end="00:47:33.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is different.</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.723" end="00:47:34.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You always say that.</p>
<p begin="00:47:33.323" end="00:47:36.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Move.</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.922" end="00:47:37.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.122" end="00:47:37.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lena, there are hundreds of students</p>
<p begin="00:47:37.323" end="00:47:38.422" style="s2">upstairs.</p>
<p begin="00:47:37.922" end="00:47:39.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:47:38.422" end="00:47:41.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can save them.</p>
<p begin="00:47:39.323" end="00:47:43.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe.</p>
<p begin="00:47:41.023" end="00:47:45.823" style="s2">But you&#39;re doing it again.</p>
<p begin="00:47:43.922" end="00:47:48.823" style="s2">You get scared and suddenly you&#39;re the</p>
<p begin="00:47:45.823" end="00:47:49.823" style="s2">only person allowed to fix everything.</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.823" end="00:47:53.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want me to do?</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.823" end="00:47:53.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ask for help. We&#39;re right here.</p>
<p begin="00:48:03.023" end="00:48:05.723" style="s2">It&#39;s working.</p>
<p begin="00:48:13.223" end="00:48:18.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You still think this is about saving a</p>
<p begin="00:48:14.622" end="00:48:18.523" style="s2">few memories? Get away from the core.</p>
<p begin="00:48:19.523" end="00:48:21.823" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:48:23.723" end="00:48:26.023" style="s2">There.</p>
<p begin="00:48:26.323" end="00:48:28.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nolan.</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.853" end="00:48:32.873" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:48:41.323" end="00:48:44.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not yet.</p>
<p begin="00:48:42.723" end="00:48:47.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because you do.</p>
<p begin="00:48:44.323" end="00:48:47.023" style="s2">I&#39;m chasing her.</p>
<p begin="00:48:47.823" end="00:48:51.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at me.</p>
<p begin="00:48:48.922" end="00:48:51.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m trying.</p>
<p begin="00:48:53.523" end="00:48:57.422" style="s2">Maisy.</p>
<p begin="00:48:55.122" end="00:48:57.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah?</p>
<p begin="00:48:57.523" end="00:49:00.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why do I know your name?</p>
<p begin="00:49:01.524" end="00:49:04.913" style="s2">Tell me something.</p>
<p begin="00:49:03.524" end="00:49:05.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:49:04.913" end="00:49:06.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:49:05.124" end="00:49:07.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anything.</p>
<p begin="00:49:06.424" end="00:49:08.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You steal my fries?</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.724" end="00:49:09.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s terrible.</p>
<p begin="00:49:08.824" end="00:49:09.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Very.</p>
<p begin="00:49:09.498" end="00:49:10.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:49:09.824" end="00:49:11.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What else?</p>
<p begin="00:49:10.924" end="00:49:14.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re arrogant.</p>
<p begin="00:49:11.924" end="00:49:14.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know that one.</p>
<p begin="00:49:14.724" end="00:49:18.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You hate Oscar.</p>
<p begin="00:49:15.724" end="00:49:18.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can hear you.</p>
<p begin="00:49:20.024" end="00:49:22.924" style="s2">Lena.</p>
<p begin="00:49:21.624" end="00:49:26.224" style="s2">I forgot our first date.</p>
<p begin="00:49:22.924" end="00:49:26.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have maybe two minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:49:28.024" end="00:49:30.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:49:29.024" end="00:49:30.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mm, insurance.</p>
<p begin="00:49:30.324" end="00:49:32.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:49:30.924" end="00:49:35.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not sacrificing myself.</p>
<p begin="00:49:32.924" end="00:49:35.424" style="s2">I promise.</p>
<p begin="00:49:35.924" end="00:49:37.724" style="s2">But if I forget</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.724" end="00:49:40.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:49:37.724" end="00:49:43.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lena. [music] Don&#39;t chase me.</p>
<p begin="00:49:40.824" end="00:49:45.524" style="s2">Don&#39;t stand there trying to convince me.</p>
<p begin="00:49:43.524" end="00:49:47.544" style="s2">You already did that once.</p>
<p begin="00:49:45.524" end="00:49:47.544" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:49:49.024" end="00:49:51.424" style="s2">Can I?</p>
<p begin="00:49:51.724" end="00:49:56.659" style="s2">If I&#39;m still me,</p>
<p begin="00:49:54.224" end="00:49:58.679" style="s2">I&#39;ll come to you.</p>
<p begin="00:49:56.659" end="00:49:58.679" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:50:03.324" end="00:50:06.024" style="s2">Who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:50:07.794" end="00:50:09.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:50:08.524" end="00:50:11.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened?</p>
<p begin="00:50:09.724" end="00:50:14.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Memory damage.</p>
<p begin="00:50:11.824" end="00:50:14.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How much?</p>
<p begin="00:50:14.724" end="00:50:17.424" style="s2">Do I know her?</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.524" end="00:50:21.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nolan, don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:50:22.524" end="00:50:25.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s your name?</p>
<p begin="00:50:25.324" end="00:50:27.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lena.</p>
<p begin="00:50:27.324" end="00:50:28.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Were we</p>
<p begin="00:50:27.724" end="00:50:31.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t need to figure it out right</p>
<p begin="00:50:28.824" end="00:50:31.124" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:50:38.624" end="00:50:44.224" style="s2">That&#39;s Lena, Nolan&#39;s girlfriend.</p>
<p begin="00:50:41.224" end="00:50:44.224" style="s2">I heard he forgot her again.</p>
<p begin="00:50:46.824" end="00:50:51.424" style="s2">Nolan?</p>
<p begin="00:50:48.624" end="00:50:54.124" style="s2">President Graves?</p>
<p begin="00:50:51.424" end="00:50:54.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give me a [music] second.</p>
<p begin="00:50:57.424" end="00:51:01.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t turn around.</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.924" end="00:51:01.524" style="s2">I &#39;m not.</p>
<p begin="00:51:01.724" end="00:51:04.225" style="s2">He&#39;s coming.</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.125" end="00:51:10.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lena.</p>
<p begin="00:51:13.925" end="00:51:16.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:51:15.125" end="00:51:17.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:51:16.025" end="00:51:20.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why did you follow me?</p>
<p begin="00:51:17.225" end="00:51:20.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know that either.</p>
<p begin="00:51:21.125" end="00:51:23.225" style="s2">Were we dating?</p>
<p begin="00:51:22.225" end="00:51:24.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:51:23.225" end="00:51:25.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Before I forgot?</p>
<p begin="00:51:24.425" end="00:51:26.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.425" end="00:51:27.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And after?</p>
<p begin="00:51:26.625" end="00:51:28.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Complicated.</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.725" end="00:51:30.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That sounds bad.</p>
<p begin="00:51:28.825" end="00:51:32.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were annoying.</p>
<p begin="00:51:30.525" end="00:51:33.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Apparently that&#39;s consistent.</p>
<p begin="00:51:32.425" end="00:51:34.525" style="s2">Can I ask you something?</p>
<p begin="00:51:33.925" end="00:51:37.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:51:34.525" end="00:51:37.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why do I feel like I know you?</p>
<p begin="00:51:38.025" end="00:51:40.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe you did.</p>
<p begin="00:51:44.825" end="00:51:48.525" style="s2">For your girlfriend?</p>
<p begin="00:51:45.625" end="00:51:48.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t have a girlfriend.</p>
<p begin="00:51:55.825" end="00:51:58.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did you know?</p>
<p begin="00:51:58.725" end="00:52:01.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I guessed.</p>
<p begin="00:51:59.725" end="00:52:02.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, you didn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:52:01.325" end="00:52:04.385" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:52:02.525" end="00:52:06.405" style="s2">I don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:52:04.385" end="00:52:06.405" style="s2">[crying]</p>
<p begin="00:52:09.025" end="00:52:11.925" style="s2">Did I hurt you</p>
<p begin="00:52:10.525" end="00:52:14.225" style="s2">before?</p>
<p begin="00:52:11.925" end="00:52:14.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:52:14.325" end="00:52:18.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Am I doing it now?</p>
<p begin="00:52:16.725" end="00:52:21.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:52:18.525" end="00:52:21.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dal, open the core.</p>
<p begin="00:52:24.625" end="00:52:29.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:52:27.025" end="00:52:32.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s okay.</p>
<p begin="00:52:29.525" end="00:52:32.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay with me.</p>
<p begin="00:52:42.225" end="00:52:47.025" style="s2">The next pulse could wipe everything.</p>
<p begin="00:52:44.025" end="00:52:48.525" style="s2">Everything. Recent memory first.</p>
<p begin="00:52:47.025" end="00:52:50.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So I could forget today?</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.525" end="00:52:52.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:52:50.125" end="00:52:52.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And her?</p>
<p begin="00:52:54.525" end="00:52:57.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to come.</p>
<p begin="00:52:56.525" end="00:52:59.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you?</p>
<p begin="00:52:57.825" end="00:53:00.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maisie&#39;s memories are still connected to</p>
<p begin="00:52:59.225" end="00:53:01.825" style="s2">the core.</p>
<p begin="00:53:00.725" end="00:53:04.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;m coming.</p>
<p begin="00:53:01.825" end="00:53:06.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t even remember me.</p>
<p begin="00:53:04.125" end="00:53:06.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:53:06.525" end="00:53:09.727" style="s2">Still</p>
<p begin="00:53:06.727" end="00:53:09.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; don&#39;t want you going alone.</p>
<p begin="00:53:19.227" end="00:53:22.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why did you do that?</p>
<p begin="00:53:20.227" end="00:53:22.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:53:26.027" end="00:53:29.027" style="s2">I don&#39;t know why I know your coffee. I</p>
<p begin="00:53:27.427" end="00:53:30.327" style="s2">don&#39;t know why I keep looking for you,</p>
<p begin="00:53:29.027" end="00:53:32.627" style="s2">and I definitely don&#39;t know why I keep</p>
<p begin="00:53:30.327" end="00:53:34.427" style="s2">getting hit for you.</p>
<p begin="00:53:32.627" end="00:53:36.327" style="s2">But apparently</p>
<p begin="00:53:34.427" end="00:53:37.327" style="s2">I&#39;m an idiot around you.</p>
<p begin="00:53:36.327" end="00:53:39.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:53:37.327" end="00:53:39.727" style="s2">You really are.</p>
<p begin="00:53:41.827" end="00:53:46.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you&#39;ve forgotten everything</p>
<p begin="00:53:44.627" end="00:53:46.827" style="s2">good</p>
<p begin="00:53:51.227" end="00:53:53.827" style="s2">If you forgot everything, stop trying to</p>
<p begin="00:53:52.727" end="00:53:56.727" style="s2">be me.</p>
<p begin="00:53:53.827" end="00:53:56.727" style="s2">I already screwed this up.</p>
<p begin="00:53:57.027" end="00:54:00.027" style="s2">The core can&#39;t tell the difference</p>
<p begin="00:53:57.927" end="00:54:01.427" style="s2">between memory and identity. It thinks</p>
<p begin="00:54:00.027" end="00:54:03.227" style="s2">if you remove the memory, you remove the</p>
<p begin="00:54:01.427" end="00:54:05.927" style="s2">problem.</p>
<p begin="00:54:03.227" end="00:54:05.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sounds familiar.</p>
<p begin="00:54:10.802" end="00:54:14.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:54:11.827" end="00:54:16.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You loved me.</p>
<p begin="00:54:14.227" end="00:54:16.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t touch me.</p>
<p begin="00:54:18.327" end="00:54:22.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you see?</p>
<p begin="00:54:20.527" end="00:54:24.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me.</p>
<p begin="00:54:22.627" end="00:54:26.527" style="s2">I was cruel.</p>
<p begin="00:54:24.727" end="00:54:27.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:54:26.527" end="00:54:29.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:54:27.527" end="00:54:29.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There!</p>
<p begin="00:54:30.527" end="00:54:34.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The ninth overtone core.</p>
<p begin="00:54:38.312" end="00:54:42.027" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:54:39.827" end="00:54:42.027" style="s2">Better?</p>
<p begin="00:54:47.327" end="00:54:49.927" style="s2">You&#39;re too late.</p>
<p begin="00:54:56.227" end="00:54:58.827" style="s2">I told everyone I was doing this to</p>
<p begin="00:54:57.427" end="00:55:00.827" style="s2">protect Lena.</p>
<p begin="00:54:58.827" end="00:55:02.227" style="s2">That was only half true.</p>
<p begin="00:55:00.827" end="00:55:03.827" style="s2">I was scared.</p>
<p begin="00:55:02.227" end="00:55:04.927" style="s2">I knew what the bell could do,</p>
<p begin="00:55:03.827" end="00:55:06.727" style="s2">and I couldn&#39;t stand the thought of</p>
<p begin="00:55:04.927" end="00:55:08.328" style="s2">watching her disappear.</p>
<p begin="00:55:06.727" end="00:55:10.028" style="s2">So I did what I always</p>
<p begin="00:55:08.328" end="00:55:11.528" style="s2">I made the decision myself. I told</p>
<p begin="00:55:10.028" end="00:55:13.028" style="s2">myself it was for her.</p>
<p begin="00:55:11.528" end="00:55:15.128" style="s2">But part of it was for me. If you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:55:13.028" end="00:55:18.028" style="s2">watching this with her,</p>
<p begin="00:55:15.128" end="00:55:18.028" style="s2">listen to her this time.</p>
<p begin="00:55:20.228" end="00:55:25.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What does purge mean?</p>
<p begin="00:55:22.328" end="00:55:27.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s destroying the stored memories.</p>
<p begin="00:55:25.228" end="00:55:29.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:55:27.128" end="00:55:30.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because you can&#39;t expose what no longer</p>
<p begin="00:55:29.328" end="00:55:32.228" style="s2">exists.</p>
<p begin="00:55:30.728" end="00:55:34.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; May these memories</p>
<p begin="00:55:32.228" end="00:55:34.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All of them.</p>
<p begin="00:55:38.828" end="00:55:42.628" style="s2">What do you need?</p>
<p begin="00:55:40.628" end="00:55:43.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep those three stable.</p>
<p begin="00:55:42.628" end="00:55:45.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How long?</p>
<p begin="00:55:43.628" end="00:55:48.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:55:45.528" end="00:55:50.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have two.</p>
<p begin="00:55:48.128" end="00:55:53.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at you.</p>
<p begin="00:55:50.328" end="00:55:53.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t get used to it.</p>
<p begin="00:56:04.828" end="00:56:07.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now.</p>
<p begin="00:56:21.428" end="00:56:26.828" style="s2">Oh my god. They really were together.</p>
<p begin="00:56:23.928" end="00:56:26.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He was chasing her.</p>
<p begin="00:56:30.528" end="00:56:34.928" style="s2">Together?</p>
<p begin="00:56:32.428" end="00:56:34.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Together.</p>
<p begin="00:56:58.528" end="00:57:02.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You okay?</p>
<p begin="00:56:59.828" end="00:57:02.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ask me later.</p>
<p begin="00:57:02.728" end="00:57:04.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal.</p>
<p begin="00:57:22.719" end="00:57:25.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:57:23.029" end="00:57:25.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lena.</p>
<p begin="00:57:25.339" end="00:57:29.329" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:57:27.229" end="00:57:31.129" style="s2">We were wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:57:29.329" end="00:57:33.629" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:57:31.129" end="00:57:33.629" style="s2">You were cruel.</p>
<p begin="00:57:34.529" end="00:57:37.629" style="s2">But thank you for saying it.</p>
<p begin="00:57:38.329" end="00:57:41.229" style="s2">This belongs to you.</p>
<p begin="00:57:41.529" end="00:57:45.529" style="s2">I should have given it to you that day.</p>
<p begin="00:57:43.629" end="00:57:47.829" style="s2">Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:57:45.529" end="00:57:49.829" style="s2">You&#39;re really not making this easy.</p>
<p begin="00:57:47.829" end="00:57:51.329" style="s2">Not my job.</p>
<p begin="00:57:49.829" end="00:57:54.529" style="s2">Fair.</p>
<p begin="00:57:51.329" end="00:57:55.929" style="s2">He&#39;s terrible at being subtle. I know.</p>
<p begin="00:57:54.529" end="00:57:57.729" style="s2">You going to say yes?</p>
<p begin="00:57:55.929" end="00:57:59.829" style="s2">To what?</p>
<p begin="00:57:57.729" end="00:58:01.329" style="s2">Whatever that idiot is doing.</p>
<p begin="00:57:59.829" end="00:58:02.329" style="s2">You still scared?</p>
<p begin="00:58:01.329" end="00:58:03.329" style="s2">Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:58:02.329" end="00:58:06.129" style="s2">Good.</p>
<p begin="00:58:03.329" end="00:58:06.129" style="s2">Means you&#39;re not stupid.</p>
<p begin="00:58:06.429" end="00:58:08.929" style="s2">What are you [music] doing?</p>
<p begin="00:58:07.729" end="00:58:10.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:58:08.929" end="00:58:12.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re a terrible liar.</p>
<p begin="00:58:10.329" end="00:58:12.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So I&#39;ve been told.</p>
<p begin="00:58:13.329" end="00:58:17.085" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this a proposal?</p>
<p begin="00:58:14.529" end="00:58:17.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jesus, Lena, we&#39;re 19 and 21.</p>
<p begin="00:58:17.085" end="00:58:18.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:58:17.529" end="00:58:19.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good answer.</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.429" end="00:58:20.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you leave?</p>
<p begin="00:58:19.129" end="00:58:20.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Absolutely not.</p>
<p begin="00:58:20.029" end="00:58:23.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maisie.</p>
<p begin="00:58:20.729" end="00:58:23.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:58:25.329" end="00:58:27.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow night.</p>
<p begin="00:58:26.529" end="00:58:28.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about it?</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.329" end="00:58:28.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meet me here.</p>
<p begin="00:58:28.229" end="00:58:30.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:58:28.929" end="00:58:32.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I am asking.</p>
<p begin="00:58:30.029" end="00:58:34.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not an explanation.</p>
<p begin="00:58:32.829" end="00:58:36.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all you&#39;re getting.</p>
<p begin="00:58:34.529" end="00:58:36.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:58:37.029" end="00:58:39.629" style="s2">Was Mr. President nervous?</p>
<p begin="00:58:38.729" end="00:58:41.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:58:39.629" end="00:58:44.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were.</p>
<p begin="00:58:41.729" end="00:58:44.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go away.</p>
<p begin="00:58:46.329" end="00:58:49.729" style="s2">If she comes,</p>
<p begin="00:58:47.929" end="00:58:52.529" style="s2">don&#39;t use my words.</p>
<p begin="00:58:49.729" end="00:58:52.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wasn&#39;t planning to.</p>
<p begin="00:58:53.829" end="00:58:58.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lena.</p>
<p begin="00:58:55.629" end="00:58:59.829" style="s2">I&#39;m not late. You&#39;re always late.</p>
<p begin="00:58:58.729" end="00:59:03.329" style="s2">She is.</p>
<p begin="00:58:59.829" end="00:59:05.629" style="s2">Nobody asked you. Still [music] true.</p>
<p begin="00:59:03.329" end="00:59:08.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Steter and Herax.</p>
<p begin="00:59:05.629" end="00:59:08.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; President Graves.</p>
<p begin="00:59:09.529" end="00:59:10.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re doing it again.</p>
<p begin="00:59:10.429" end="00:59:11.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:59:10.795" end="00:59:11.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:59:11.129" end="00:59:13.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That face.</p>
<p begin="00:59:11.829" end="00:59:16.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What face? The Lena face.</p>
<p begin="00:59:13.831" end="00:59:17.431" style="s2">Shut up.</p>
<p begin="00:59:16.131" end="00:59:18.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. President.</p>
<p begin="00:59:17.431" end="00:59:19.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Trouble?</p>
<p begin="00:59:18.331" end="00:59:21.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still arrogant?</p>
<p begin="00:59:19.331" end="00:59:21.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still here.</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.831" end="00:59:28.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is your big surprise?</p>
<p begin="00:59:26.931" end="00:59:29.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; hate big [music] surprises?</p>
<p begin="00:59:28.331" end="00:59:29.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; True.</p>
<p begin="00:59:29.031" end="00:59:31.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you like fries?</p>
<p begin="00:59:29.931" end="00:59:31.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:59:31.131" end="00:59:34.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I bought them.</p>
<p begin="00:59:31.931" end="00:59:34.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And now they&#39;re mine.</p>
<p begin="00:59:36.031" end="00:59:41.231" style="s2">You okay?</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.931" end="00:59:41.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ask me in 30 seconds.</p>
<p begin="00:59:51.431" end="00:59:54.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you remember me?</p>
<p begin="00:59:53.231" end="00:59:56.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:59:54.231" end="00:59:57.731" style="s2">Who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:59:56.531" end="00:59:59.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nolan.</p>
<p begin="00:59:57.731" end="01:00:02.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are such an</p>
<p begin="00:59:59.931" end="01:00:03.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, okay.</p>
<p begin="01:00:02.031" end="01:00:04.731" style="s2">I don&#39;t remember everything.</p>
<p begin="01:00:03.631" end="01:00:06.631" style="s2">I don&#39;t remember the first time I fell</p>
<p begin="01:00:04.731" end="01:00:09.631" style="s2">for you.</p>
<p begin="01:00:06.631" end="01:00:09.631" style="s2">But I remember the second.</p>
<p begin="01:00:11.031" end="01:00:13.331" style="s2">Can I?</p>
<p begin="01:00:13.431" end="01:00:17.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You asked too many questions.</p>
<p begin="01:00:15.731" end="01:00:18.431" style="s2">So what happens tomorrow?</p>
<p begin="01:00:17.531" end="01:00:20.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow?</p>
<p begin="01:00:18.431" end="01:00:21.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if you wake up and forget me again?</p>
<p begin="01:00:20.731" end="01:00:24.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I guess I&#39;ll have to find you</p>
<p begin="01:00:21.831" end="01:00:24.131" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="01:00:24.331" end="01:00:27.131" style="s2">Lena.</p>
<p begin="01:00:25.931" end="01:00:29.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:00:27.131" end="01:00:29.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I found you.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
